<div style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 0 20px;">
  
  <!-- Hero Banner -->
  <div style="text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #000); border: 3px solid; border-image: linear-gradient(90deg, {{ settings.color_accent }}, {{ settings.color_pink }}, {{ settings.color_orange }}, {{ settings.color_yellow }}) 1; margin-bottom: 60px;">
    <h1 style="font-family: {{ settings.font_heading.family }}, Impact, sans-serif; color: {{ settings.color_accent }}; font-size: 4rem; margin: 0 0 20px 0; text-transform: uppercase; text-shadow: 0 0 20px {{ settings.color_accent }};">
      {{ page.title }}
    </h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0;">
      HOME OF THE CAMO FROG
    </p>
  </div>
  
  <!-- About Content -->
  <div style="line-height: 1.8; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #ddd;">
    
    <!-- Tagline -->
    <div style="text-align: center; padding: 40px 20px; background: #1a1a1a; border-left: 5px solid {{ settings.color_accent }}; margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <p style="font-size: 2rem; font-style: italic; color: {{ settings.color_accent }}; margin: 0;">
        "We didn't invent the chase — we perfected the strike."
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Page Content -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
      {{ page.content }}
    </div>

    <!-- Legacy / Founder Story -->
    <div style="background: #1a1a1a; padding: 40px; border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid {{ settings.color_accent }}; margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <h2 style="font-family: {{ settings.font_heading.family }}, Impact, sans-serif; color: {{ settings.color_accent }}; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px; text-transform: uppercase;">
        THE LEGACY
      </h2>
      <div style="color: #ccc; line-height: 1.9;">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 18px 0;">
          I started fishing when I was just 2 years old, and hunting as soon as I could walk—right alongside my father. From day one, the outdoors wasn’t just something I did… it’s who I am.
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 18px 0;">
          Growing up in South Jersey, I’ve spent a lifetime chasing fish and hunting game, especially targeting mature whitetails through the brutal winter months. Over the years, that dedication turned into results—multiple fishing tournament wins and several whitetails in the New Jersey record books.
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 18px 0;">
          Around 2016, I got hooked on chasing snakeheads—and that’s when things really changed. I became obsessed with not just catching them, but understanding the lures built to target them. How they move. How they trigger strikes. What makes them explode on a bait.
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 18px 0;">
          That obsession turned into building my own.
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 18px 0;">
          Now it’s bigger than just me.
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 18px 0;">
          My two sons, Tyler and Drew, have been raised the same way—on the water and in the woods. They’ve been hunting and fishing their entire lives, carrying on the same passion, knowledge, and drive that was passed down to me.
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 18px 0;">
          Beavercreek Lures was built from that lifestyle—real experience, time on the water, and a deep focus on creating lures designed to trigger aggressive, violent strikes.
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
          This isn’t just a brand.<br>
          It’s a legacy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Our Story Section -->
    <div style="background: #1a1a1a; padding: 40px; border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid {{ settings.color_pink }}; margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <h2 style="font-family: {{ settings.font_heading.family }}, Impact, sans-serif; color: {{ settings.color_pink }}; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px; text-transform: uppercase;">
        OUR STORY
      </h2>
      <p style="color: #ccc; line-height: 1.8;">
        At Beavercreek Lures, we strive to deliver unmatched performance strike after strike. 
        Our lures are designed with one goal in mind: to help you land trophy fish. 
        From the iconic Camo Frog to our diverse lineup of proven patterns, 
        each lure is crafted to trigger aggressive strikes in any condition.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- What Sets Us Apart -->
    <div style="background: #1a1a1a; padding: 40px; border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid {{ settings.color_orange }}; margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <h2 style="font-family: {{ settings.font_heading.family }}, Impact, sans-serif; color: {{ settings.color_orange }}; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px; text-transform: uppercase;">
        WHAT SETS US APART
      </h2>
      <ul style="color: #ccc; line-height: 2; list-style: none; padding: 0;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 30px; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: {{ settings.color_accent }}; font-size: 1.5rem;">🎣</span>
          <strong style="color: #fff;">Proven Patterns:</strong> Colors and designs that fish can't resist
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 30px; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: {{ settings.color_pink }}; font-size: 1.5rem;">💪</span>
          <strong style="color: #fff;">Tournament Tested:</strong> Used by anglers to land trophy bass and snakeheads
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 30px; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: {{ settings.color_orange }}; font-size: 1.5rem;">⚡</span>
          <strong style="color: #fff;">Deadly Action:</strong> Realistic movement that triggers strikes
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 30px; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: {{ settings.color_yellow }}; font-size: 1.5rem;">👑</span>
          <strong style="color: #fff;">Quality Craftsmanship:</strong> Built to last, designed to perform
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <!-- CTA -->
    <div style="text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px;">
      <h3 style="font-family: {{ settings.font_heading.family }}, Impact, sans-serif; color: {{ settings.color_yellow }}; font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 30px; text-transform: uppercase;">
        READY TO LAND YOUR TROPHY?
      </h3>
      <a href="/collections/all" class="btn-primary btn-primary--lg">
        SHOP LURES
      </a>
    </div>
    
  </div>
  
</div>
